{"id":"n38269-1-7","stage":2,"title":"기사 · 司机","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38269-1-7-1","ko":"기사님, 이 버스가 시청에 가나요?","zh":"司机先生，这辆公交车是去市政府吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"기사님,","meaning":"司机，驾驶员，操作员","explanation":"기사：司机，驾驶员，操作员；님：尊称后缀。","readings":[{"term":"기사","audio":"/audio/1f896d183072b81262d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38269","senseId":"1","lemma":"기사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"버스가","meaning":"公共汽车，公交车","explanation":"버스：公共汽车，公交车；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"버스","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36678","senseId":"1","lemma":"버스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시청에","meaning":"市政府，市厅","explanation":"시청：市政府，市厅；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시청","audio":"/audio/d089c9bf766d3808ef00.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65312","senseId":"1","lemma":"시청","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가나요?","meaning":"去，开往，飞向","explanation":"가다：去，开往，飞向；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"2","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1f896d183072b812","term":"기사","zh":"司机，驾驶员，操作员","audio":"/audio/1f896d183072b81262d9.mp3","entryId":"38269","definition":"职业驾驶汽车或操作机械设备等的人。","pronunciation":["기사"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"fb84fa7f86eac62e","term":"버스","zh":"公共汽车，公交车","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3","entryId":"36678","definition":"收取费用、按照规定路线行驶、可乘坐多人的大汽车。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"d089c9bf766d3808","term":"시청","zh":"市政